{"2548770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roach Royale", "steam_appid": 2548770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a rumor about a project buried deep inside some forgotten server - something that was never meant to be released. And once you open it… there’s no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not really a game. It’s a never-ending nightmare coded for people whose minds are already stuck inside the machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Roach Royale</strong> - a brutal online horror experience where 44 players fight like hell for the slim chance to escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path Through Purgatory:</strong> Your only goal is to reach the end of the map. Standing between you and freedom are heavy reinforced doors, brutal grinding traps, and creatures that used to be your friends. They don’t show mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Your Own Nightmare:</strong> When you die, you don’t just disconnect. You come back as one of the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate or Betray:</strong> You can help your team push through the traps… or betray them. Your choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quantum Imprisonment:</strong> Every player is just another sinner trapped in the code. You all get one shot at getting out - if you can actually cross that finish line alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts now. Watch your back… and remember to breathe while you still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Roach Royale.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a rumor about a project buried deep inside some forgotten server - something that was never meant to be released. And once you open it… there’s no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’